li>Mind-affecting</li>  </ul></li>     </ul>  </div><div><div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"offense\"><h4>Offense</h4><hr /><strong>Speed</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"speed\">  <li>Land 30 ft</li>  <li>Fly 30 ft (Poor)</li>  </ul><br />  <strong>Melee</strong> bite +1 (1d4)<br />   <ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\">   </ul>   </div></div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"statistics\"><h4>Statistics</h4><hr /><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"attributes\"><li><strong>Str</strong> 10</li><li><strong>Dex</strong> 11</li><li><strong>Con</strong> 11</li><li><strong>Int</strong>  —</li><li><strong>Wis</strong> 10</li><li><strong>Cha</strong> 7</li></ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\" data-content=\"base-attack\"><li><strong>Base Atk</strong>+0</li><li><strong>CMB</strong> -1</li><li><strong>CMD</strong> 9  (17 vs. trip) </li></ul><br />   <strong>Skills</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"skills\">  <li>Fly -2</li>  </ul>  <br />    <strong>SQ</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"sq\">  <li>luminescence</li>  </ul><br />   </div>  <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"ecology\"><h4>Ecology</h4><hr />  <strong>Environment</strong>   any <br />   <strong>Organization</strong>  solitary, cluster (2-6) or colony (7-12)<br />   <strong>Treasure</strong>  none   <br />  </div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"special-abilities\"><h4> Special Abilities </h4><hr />  <p><strong>Luminescence (Ex)</strong> A fire beetle's glowing glands provide light in a 10-foot radius. A dead fire beetle's luminescent glands continue to glow for 1d6 days after its death.    </p>  </div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"description\"><h4> Description </h4><hr /><div class=\"sbcPreWrap\">\nAlthough nocturnal, the fire beetle lacks darkvision- it relies on its own glowing glands for illumination.\n\nCaged fire beetles are a popular source of long-lasting illumination among eccentrics and miners.\n\nOther variations on the common fire beetle exist. The two most common variants are detailed below.\n\nMining Beetle (CR 1/2): A mining beetle is an advanced fire beetle with the advanced simple template and a burrowing speed of 20 feet.\n\nFlash Beetle (CR 1/2): A flash beetle is an advanced fire beetle that can create a bright flash of light once an hour. When a flash beetle does so, all creatures in a 10- foot burst must make a DC 12 Fortitude save or be dazzled for 1d3 rounds.\n\nThe save DC is Constitution-based.\n</div></div>  </div><hr class=\"sbcBorder\" /></div><p></p></div><br /><hr /><div class=\"rawInputContainer\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><h2 style=\"text-align:middle;border:none;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000\">RAW INPUT</h2><hr /><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px\">    Fire Beetle (CR 0.33)\nSource PFRPG Bestiary \nCR 1/3 \nXP 135 \nN Small vermin  \nInit +0; Senses low-light vision; Perception +0   \nDefense   \nAC 12, touch 11, flat-footed 12 (+1 natural, +1 size)\n\nhp 4 (1d8)\n\nFort +2, Ref +0, Will +0 \nImmune mind-affecting effects   \nOffense   \nSpd 30 ft., fly 30 ft. (poor)\n\nMelee bite +1 (1d4)\n\n\n\nStatistics   \nStr 10, Dex 11, Con 11, Int -, Wis 10, Cha 7 \nBase Atk +0; CMB -1; CMD 9 (17 vs. trip)\n\nSkills Fly -2 \nSQ luminescence   \nEcology   \nEnvironment  any \nOrganization solitary, cluster (2-6) or colony (7-12)\n\nTreasure none   \nSpecial abilities   \nLuminescence (Ex) A fire beetle's glowing glands provide light in a 10-foot radius. A dead fire beetle's luminescent glands continue to glow for 1d6 days after its death.   \nDescription\n\nAlthough nocturnal, the fire beetle lacks darkvision- it relies on its own glowing glands for illumination.\n\nCaged fire beetles are a popular source of long-lasting illumination among eccentrics and miners.\n\nOther variations on the common fire beetle exist. The two most common variants are detailed below.\n\nMining Beetle (CR 1/2): A mining beetle is an advanced fire beetle with the advanced simple template and a burrowing speed of 20 feet.\n\nFlash Beetle (CR 1/2): A flash beetle is an advanced fire beetle that can create a bright flash of light once an hour. When a flash beetle does so, all creatures in a 10- foot burst must make a DC 12 Fortitude save or be dazzled for 1d3 rounds.\n\nThe save DC is Constitution-based.\n    </pre></div>"},"cr":{"base":0.33},"xp":{"value":0}},"skills":{"acr":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"apr":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"art":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"blf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"clm":{"ability":"str","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"crf":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dip":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dev":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"dis":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"esc":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"fly":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"han":{"ability":"cha","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"hea":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"int":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kar":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kdu":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ken":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kge":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"khi":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"klo":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kna":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kno":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kpl":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kre":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lin":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lor":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"per":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"prf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"pro":{"ability":"wis","rt